          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP 195 Edmonton Emily murphy park. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for another cap this one confused me a bit but after looking at other logs I'm pretty confident I got it right thanks for another cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="684564874">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-07T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3339080">Gimli*/GeoJoce</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP195 Edmonton Emily Murphy Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A bit of a walk to get here from my last find and I'll admit I sat on the ground for a bit catching my breath and wondering what to do here.  The first cap like this I've found and I was worried about being able to uncover this one.  Thankfully my piano fingers have a bit of muscle to them and I managed to lift the cover and reveal the cap.....well, reveal whatever was in there.  I think the rain has done it's duty here and filled the caps home with something but I wasn't willing to reach my arm in.  I took my pics, sent my pics and give thanks to the CO for approving.  :)  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back to the car, out of the muggley park and now heading in home direction with time for a few more (of course).  TFTBC OFTH!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="683766371">
          <groundspeak:date>2017-05-04T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="7458582">mkPerry</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP195 Edmonton Emily Murphy Park 

Picked this one up on our way out of Emily Murphy Park. Survey Manholes always make the find easier. Couldn't read any numbers after opening it though. Couple people walked by but they didn't say anything although I'm sure they were wondering what I was up to. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
